1
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Something crooked this way comes.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Hellboy: The Crooked Man is a fantasy, horror,
action film directed by Brian Taylor.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Hellboy and a rookie BPRD agent get stranded in 1950s rural Appalachia.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
There, they discover a small community haunted by witches, led by a local devil
with a troubling connection to Hellboy's past: the Crooked Man.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Hellboy, played by Jack Kesy.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Tom Ferrell, played by Jefferson White.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Bobbie Jo Song, played by Adeline Rudolph.

8
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Effie Kolb, played by Leah McNamara.

9
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Cora Fisher, played by Hannah Margetson.

10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
The Crooked Man, played by Martin Bassindale.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Hellboy: The Crooked Man is a 2024 American superhero horror film, based on the
Dark Horse Comics character Hellboy created by Mike Mignola.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Produced by Millennium Media, Dark Horse Entertainment, Nu Boyana Film Studios, and Campbell Grobman Films, it is
the second reboot of the Hellboy film series and is the fourth live-action entry in the franchise.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
It is directed by Brian Taylor from a script he wrote with Mignola and Christopher
Golden, adapting The Crooked Man limited series written by Mignola.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The film stars Jack Kesy as Hellboy, alongside Jefferson
White and Adeline Rudolph in her film debut.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
Filming began in March 2023, in Bulgaria, and was completed in May.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
Hellboy: The Crooked Man was released in Belgium on June 20, 2024, and was released
direct-to-VOD in the United States by Ketchup Entertainment on October 8, 2024.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The film received mixed reviews from critics and has
grossed $2 million in international markets.

18
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The film explores themes of witch, spider, based on comic, coal mine, 1950s.

19
01:35:00,000 --> 01:35:06,000
The tone is dark.
